sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Domain owner
  participant P1 as S13 admission
  participant P2 as S13 rating
  participant P3 as Payment provider
  participant P4 as Customer UI
  alt Required current prerequisites hold
    P0->>P1: 1 Submit immutable measured usage receipt
    P1->>P1: 2 Verify source scope metric unit and identity
    P1->>P2: 3 Admit once under frozen contract
    P2->>P2: 4 Apply exact price allowance and currency rules
    P2->>P2: 5 Post immutable invoice
    P2->>P3: 6 Request collection with stable payment identity
    P3->>P1: 7 Deliver deduplicated provider event
    P1->>P2: 8 Reconcile or adjust payment
    P2->>P4: 9 Show attributable invoice and economics
  else A prerequisite fails or an external outcome is uncertain
    Note over P0,P4: Unknown completion is not invented usage. A reservation is not a charge. Credits and corrections retain the original posted facts.
  end
